  "releaseNotes": "Initial release with support for:\n\t\t\t- Automatic token management (grant/refresh)\n\t\t\t- Payment creation and execution\n\t\t\t- Payment status query\n\t\t\t- Refund processing with status tracking\n\t\t\t- Multi-environment support (sandbox/production)\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive error handling with specific exception types\n\t\t\t- Health check integration for monitoring\n\t\t\t- Webhook signature verification\n\t\t\t- Strongly-typed request/response models\n\t\t\t- Built-in validation for all requests\n\t\t\t- Singleton token service for efficient token caching",
